    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d572">

                <pb facs="0546" n="534" sameAs="frus:frus1944v05/pg534"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">881.00/2740: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Casablanca</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Casablanca</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-01-14T16:00:00+01:00">January 14, 1944—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received January 15—12:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>18. Referring to my 11, January 8, 1 p.m. Possible native demonstration here
                    tomorrow night, thought to be stirred up by certain Nationalists, has been
                    responsible for cancellation all permissions to American officers and enlisted
                    personnel as from noon January 15 for indefinite period.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Algiers as my 4, to Tangier as my 5, and true reading Rabat.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
